	(text "VBAT_MCU = max(+3V3, AFE_REG1) - 0.3 V (D109); AFE_REG1 from U201 (sheet 02).\n+5V_USB only from the service USB-C (sheet 06, GND_USB domain).\nPWR_EN latch (sheet 01) enables U101; +12V / +3V3_ESP / +5V_ISO are MCU-switched leaves." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 41.91 176.53 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0292a565-92fc-4fb7-987c-32a5a086a6ed"))
	(text "Power board: +3V3, +3V3_A, +12V, GND_PWR over J206 / J701; VSUP_TAP back from F701 at the B+ lug." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 41.91 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "773dfac1-1275-4f09-ba4a-3b49106a1034"))
	(rectangle (start 229.87 138.43) (end 383.54 207.01) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 0 132 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "cf85d972-b728-492e-8899-da803b7477c3"))
	(text "Ground domains (never merged)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14000000000001 139.70000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "89747667-d756-4c45-ae1a-d6684fa7377f"))
	(text "GND_PWR - signal ground of both boards (AFE VSS, MCU, B2B pins 13 / 17 / 30).\n      Joins the 200 A copper BAT- at one net tie only: NT401 (sheet 04, shunt Kelvin edge).\nGND_ISO - CAN / RS-485 bus side: U106 B0505S output (sheet 01), barriers U601-U604 (sheet 06).\nGND_USB - service USB-C only: barrier U606 ISO7721 (sheet 06).\nCHASSIS - RJ45 shields + MH601-MH604 (control), MH701-MH706 (power);\n      1 nF 2 kV // 1 MOhm to GND_ISO (C618 / R626, sheet 06)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 233.68 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "380151d3-1eba-45a7-affa-1cc328b828fe"))
