	(text "Pin n <-> pin n. Pins 1-8 HV group: VSUP_TAP, AFE_PACK, AFE_CHG, AFE_DSG (x2), AFE_PCHG,\nAFE_PDSG, AFE_LD; pins 9-10 empty creepage gap.\nPins 11-30 LV: SHUNT_K_BAT / _PACK, ISENSE_OUT, NTC_FET, NTC_SHUNT, +3V3_A, OC_TRIP_N, OC_CLR,\nFET_EN, MCU_NRST, AFE_FLT_DSG_N / _CHG_N, AFE_DFETOFF, KILL_N, HEATER_EN, +3V3, +12V, GND_PWR x3.\nPower board adds fail-safe pull-downs on FET_EN, MCU_NRST, AFE_FLT_*_N, HEATER_EN." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 41.91 227.33 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c972f5db-64bd-4463-b8f1-3e92d342feba"))
	(rectangle (start 229.87 209.55) (end 383.54 248.92) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 0 132 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "62abd037-dfe1-4ef1-a2bf-cfaef47ef445"))
	(text "Wake chain and kill chain" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14000000000001 210.82000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7bda4c93-b361-4f1c-aa0f-1471c385cff8"))
	(text "WAKE: WAKE_BTN_N (Q101) / AFE_ALERT (Q102) / AUX_IN / PWR_HOLD -> diode OR -> PWR_EN\n      -> U101 EN -> +5V -> +3V3 -> MCU boots -> PWR_HOLD high holds the latch (sheet 01)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 233.68 216.79 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "81c71c54-4464-40f9-9b68-42eb46f6b194"))
	(text "KILL: FET_EN . OC_TRIP_N . MCU_NRST -> U701 -> AFE_DFETOFF;  . AFE_FLT_DSG_N . AFE_FLT_CHG_N\n      -> U702 -> KILL_N -> U703 -> 07_KILL -> gate-kill P-FETs turn off CHG + DSG banks (sheet 07)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 233.68 226.06 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8226e599-adaa-4010-ab37-cebb60c1185a"))
	(text "Any input low = FETs off; every input has a fail-safe pull-down." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 233.68 235.71 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3c49ee9f-46d6-4382-b576-338ed6e3e452"))
